UID:EfZ2gNL1Bj
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nDon Hardy (Pick of the Litter\, S
 IFF 2018) returns to Seattle with this perfect cocktail of a documentary\,
  focusing on students participating in the Culinary Institute of America
 ’s BAR (Beverage Alcohol Resource) 5-Day Program\, hoping to be some of 
 the world’s greatest mixologists. Director Don Hardy scheduled to attend
 . Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/bar\n\nAlso playing at:\n
   • AMC Pacific Place 11 (Sun 18 May\, 11:00 AM)\n\nFilm is also being s
 treamed.
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
