UID:okTnXtpMZL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 71 mins (1h11m)\n\nRange rider and “wolf-protectin
 g cowboy” Daniel Curry and cattle rancher Jerry Francis try to find comm
 on ground between their conflicting interests in the forests of northeaste
 rn Washington\, just 20 miles from the Canadian border. Director Sarah Hof
 fman and editor David Wulzen scheduled to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/festival/wolf-land\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Shoreline CC T
 heater (Sat 17 May\, 5:30 PM)
