BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:She’s The He
DTSTART:20250520T223000Z
DTEND:20250521T000500Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T223000Z
UID:v85kCovBCf
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nFirst-time director Siobhan McCar
 thy put together a cast and crew of almost entirely trans\, nonbinary\, an
 d queer people to make this Bottoms-esque teen satire about two seniors wh
 o pretend to be trans during their last week of high school\, only for one
  of them to find it suits them just fine. Director Siobhan McCarthy\, prod
 ucer Vic Brandt\, and producer Halley Albert scheduled to attend. Keep the
  cinematic trans hijinks going with a chance to win tickets to the Queer &
  Trans Film Festival at the May 19 screening. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www
 .siff.net/festival/shes-the-he\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Upto
 wn House 3 (Mon 19 May\, 9:00 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
